<title>USA: BHA Group votes 10 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>BHA Group votes 10 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BHA Group Holdings Inc said Thursday its directors voted a 10 percent stock dividend, payable June 27, record June 16.</p>
<p>The company has about 6.2 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>BHA Group makes and markets industrial air pollution control parts and services worldwide.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
